Each agent drops here when it discovers something out-of-scope for the
current task. The inbox is a dropbox, not a chat log. One file per task.
Consolidate into the relevant shard on a ship point, then delete the file.

Filename convention: `<task-id-or-branch-name>.md`. The first line is a
header (`# Inbox item <task-id>`), the rest is bullets. Keep under 40 lines
per file. Do not edit a teammate's file; if it needs more, add a
`<task-id>.followup.md`.

